            <span class="text-sm fg-muted">
              Submitted by         <a href="/user/0taterfry0" class="submission__submitter fg-inherit"><strong>0taterfry0</strong></a>    <small class="fg-grey text-sm user-flag">t3_ybgfhz</small>
   <time class="submission__timestamp"
